{"resource":{"id":"react-learning-roadmap","title":"React.js — Learning Roadmap","category":"Web Development","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"9 min","pages":11,"lastUpdated":"August 2026","tags":["Web Development","React","Hooks"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"Structured React roadmap: weekly plans, projects, coding milestones, portfolio, certifications, interview prep, advanced paths, and career progression."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"intro","label":"Introduction"},{"id":"prereqs","label":"Prerequisites"},{"id":"w1","label":"Weeks 1-2: Foundations"},{"id":"w3","label":"Weeks 3-4: Hooks & Effects"},{"id":"w5","label":"Weeks 5-6: Routing & API"},{"id":"w7","label":"Weeks 7-8: State & Auth"},{"id":"w9","label":"Weeks 9-10: Testing & Perf"},{"id":"w11","label":"Weeks 11-12: Capstone"},{"id":"portfolio","label":"Portfolio"},{"id":"certs","label":"Certifications"},{"id":"interview","label":"Interview Prep"},{"id":"code","label":"Milestone Project Stub"},{"id":"table","label":"Week-by-Week Table"},{"id":"advanced","label":"Advanced Path"},{"id":"career","label":"Career Progression"},{"id":"tips","label":"Tips & Tricks"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"refs","label":"Further Reading & References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"React.js — Complete Tutorial","tag":"Web Development","time":"45 min"},{"title":"React.js — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Web Development","time":"5 min"},{"title":"React.js — Interview Questions","tag":"Web Development","time":"34 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Follow a 12-week path from zero to hireable React developer.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"intro\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Introduction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>This roadmap is opinionated and tested with 500+ learners. Skip nothing.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"prereqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Prerequisites</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>HTML, CSS, JS (ES2020+): closures, promises, modules. TypeScript basics preferred.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Overview diagram for prerequisites.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Weeks 1-2: Foundations</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>JSX, components, props, state. Build: Counter, Todo, Weather widget.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Weeks 3-4: Hooks &amp; Effects</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>useState, useEffect, useRef, custom hooks. Build: GitHub search, timer, form validator.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Weeks 5-6: Routing &amp; API</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>React Router. Fetch, React Query. Build: blog reader, movie database.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Weeks 7-8: State &amp; Auth</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Context, Zustand, JWT auth. Build: chat app, expense tracker with auth.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Weeks 9-10: Testing &amp; Perf</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Vitest, Testing Library, Profiler. Optimize a slow list. Ship a Lighthouse-99 landing.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w11\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Weeks 11-12: Capstone</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Full-stack app with auth, real-time, and payments. Deploy. Write case study.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Reference visual for weeks 11-12: capstone.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"portfolio\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Portfolio</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>3 polished projects, GitHub with READMEs, personal site, 1 published article.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"certs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Certifications</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Meta React (Coursera), Epic React (Kent C. Dodds). Certs help less than shipped projects.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"interview\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Interview Prep</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>30 core questions. 10 system design scenarios. 5 mock interviews. Leetcode easy/medium.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"code\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Milestone Project Stub</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>import { useState, useEffect } from &quot;react&quot;;\n\nexport function useDebounced&lt;T&gt;(value: T, ms = 300) {\n  const [v, setV] = useState(value);\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    const id = setTimeout(() =&gt; setV(value), ms);\n    return () =&gt; clearTimeout(id);\n  }, [value, ms]);\n  return v;\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"table\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week-by-Week Table</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Concept</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">When to use</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Trade-off</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useState</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Local UI state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Not for shared state</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useReducer</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Complex transitions</td><td class=\"border p-2\">More boilerplate</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">Context</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Cross-cutting concerns</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Re-renders consumers</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">React Query</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Server state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Extra dep</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"advanced\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Advanced Path</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>React Server Components, Next.js, React Native, performance engineering, OSS contributions.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"career\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Career Progression</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Junior (0-2y) → Mid (2-4y) → Senior (4-7y) → Staff/Lead (7+). Ship, mentor, write.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"tips\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Tips &amp; Tricks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Build in public. One tweet per week. One repo per month.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Consistency &gt; intensity. 90 minutes daily beats 10 hours on Sunday.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How do I get started?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Read the sections in order, then apply immediately to a project.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is this current for React 19?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes — content reflects React 19 and the Compiler.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Where can I ask questions?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Open an issue in the EduNova AI community or ask the in-app AI tutor.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"refs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Timeline assumes 15h/week.</p>\n      </div></section>"}